-- Ghost mode is pure invisible: submits through the stolen remote ref
-- without ever touching the textbox. (Ghost mirror removed per request.)
-- Answer source: DescriptionEvent(definition) -> word-list lookup across
-- every *Words module (ALLWords, NORMALWords, ...), PLUS the
-- ChangeAdminWordEvent override ("adminword thing").
-- Submit path: the game's TypingEvent remote renames itself to random
